# RagsMC Launcher - Environment Variables
# =========================================
# This project does NOT require any API keys or secrets.
# All Minecraft authentication is done via Microsoft's official OAuth2 flow.
# All API calls (Modrinth, Minecraft) use public endpoints.
#
# If future features require API keys, add them here as placeholders:
#
# MODRINTH_API_KEY=TU_MODRINTH_API_KEY_AQUI
# CURSEFORGE_API_KEY=TU_CURSEFORGE_API_KEY_AQUI
# DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=TU_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID_AQUI
# DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=TU_DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET_AQUI
